Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They have the advantage of terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.27,0:01:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if we strike here, for example...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,we can easily break through their defense network.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar, \Nyou've come at just the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.45,0:01:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I will show you the battle plan as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.05,0:02:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar, no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.61,0:02:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.19,0:03:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier, \Nthank you for your escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Azalar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Emerald Dofus?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,While I looked away, \NPrince Shedar took it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your duty was supposed to be protecting the Dofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Zabel, open your eyes and look at what \NI have become... what we have been reduced to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.49,0:04:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Zabel, you used the magic of the Dofus time and time again, and because of that, we have become so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So weak that your visions nearly killed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.23,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to be killed by my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know. \NBut you don't need to follow the Prince's intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the only one I can rely on. \NYou are the only one who does not wish for my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We are already one and the same now, beautiful Zabel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you always look out for me, \NI haven't rewarded you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:05:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch. Tomorrow, our powers should be restored. \NEverything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Becha. \NLenka is just like a feather. What a strange girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.83,0:05:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she? \NMaybe she's just an attention-seeker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lenka is a daughter of the Belafoon tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,, She is pure and cherishes communion with nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,She probably doesn't even know what an attention-seeker means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, lazybones. \NIf you exercised a little more regularly, you wouldn't end up like this-AH!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT IS THIS?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Belafoon tribe are rare beings chosen by the primordial dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They have inherited extraordinary powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Becha, do you recognize this scent? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Scent?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we've been walking for days and \Nhaven't had time to bathe, so sorry if I smell a bit stinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, no. \NThere's a much better smell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the scent of girolle mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Girolle? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the name of a mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, that's amazing, Lenka! \NLet's pick a bunch and fry them in a pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl is bound to be a great help on our adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Welsh's father, Canel \Nfell in love with Annette,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and with that love, protected Bonta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Welsh has fallen \Nunder the same magic as his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,F-Fell in love, you say? \NIs getting hooked like a truffle pig really such a big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.37,0:08:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mushrooms! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Pleurotus. \NIt's rare to find ones this thick and fleshy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're exaggerating. \NI can search for them too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, is it this way? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, those are just leaves? \NThen, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lenka, look at this mushroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we won't reach \Nour destination anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give them a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.72,0:08:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, \Nwe can easily make up for lost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.35,0:08:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight's a feast. \NNow we just need to find ingredients that go well with mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to go over there? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be joking, we'll get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, is something bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Shifo. \NDo you have absolutely no doubts about this mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Or doubts about your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Shedar, \Nmy father has forced me to live in hiding ever since I was born. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks of me as a terrible failure. \NHe is ashamed of me and hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell how painful it was for him to send me on this mission \Ninstead of himself just by looking into his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I will never doubt my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know very well who \Nmy father is and what he thinks of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I want to be loved by my father. \NEvery child needs a parent's love, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The vision Dardondakal showed me was barren, \Nand he said it was all because of my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what war is. \NBecause Her Majesty's dream is to unify this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it. There was no sign of war there. \NIt was as if all vitality had been sucked out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:11:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What you call your mother is nothing more \Nthan a vampire that feeds on people's vitality!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean, Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.45,0:11:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother is in danger. \NI will not let anyone harm her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H404040&\pos(100.8,249.6)\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}Episode 6: Meat and Seafood Grill
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.96,0:11:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, did you come all this way \Njust to pick that weed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't just a weed. \NIt's wild garlic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfect for seasoning mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You could smell this from that far away? \NYou're really amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure I am, but this little bit isn't enough \Nto fill our stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch. \NNow I'm going to show you what I can really do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Becha? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I caught one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, today's going to be a huge feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,White sauce would go best with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But since we don't have all the necessary ingredients, maybe steaming is better. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easier to control the heat, and the garlic \Nwill bring out the natural flavors of the ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.19,0:12:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go. \NToday's main course is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally found you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, {\i1}*cough*{\i0} \Nare you trying to {\i1}*cough*{\i0} shake us off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we just caught some ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tie them up, Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be for our sake? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lenka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's make a fire. \NIt's time for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.78,0:13:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? \NWe aren't eating while it's still daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Jojo, it's not just the children who need rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. \NBut tomorrow we set off as soon as dawn breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The key is flipping the ingredients at the \Noptimal timing and never burning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And accurate seasoning is also necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mama Caroni always said, 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"To make a successful meal, \Nthe most important thing is to cook with all your heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.35,0:14:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Mama taught me how to cook. \NIf she were here, I think you would have loved her too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:14:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was crazy about Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Like many of the people, \NMama Caroni became a victim of Zabel's madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But without her sacrifice, \Nyou wouldn't be able to enjoy meals like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go get some firewood. \NThe fire is about to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jojo, really, really, truly now... \Nloosen up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.69,0:15:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Khan, we both know those brats will be a major obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to my wife, \NI'll try to persuade her to come to her senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Karkas-san, I'll go right now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to be alone for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.93,0:16:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, \NI have three daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.89,0:16:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When those girls were crying, remembering their mother, \Nthe only thing that worked was a BIG HUG!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly ending up like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The hardship of what you carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Becha, \Neat before it gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.97,0:16:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fish is the absolute best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.65,0:16:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The garlic and mushrooms are also super delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:16:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Karkas-san, try some too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.05,0:17:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious! \NThis will revive me in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be even better if \Nwe had some licorice tea at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something, Dardondakal. \NPlease, what do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have sacrificed everything for your sake. \NEverything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the token of your gratitude to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.88,0:17:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you plotting something with the children? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you seriously think those kids \Nwill make better protectors than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you answer me, Dardondakal? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have dedicated everything to you, I should be worthy \Nof being your protector! 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.72,0:18:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you always choose someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll settle things with those two runts. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can stay silent after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as expected, it's their campfire. \NEveryone is here. And even the new girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl had a special, suspicious scent to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:18:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,His injuries have healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pour all our strength into Welsh. \NWe won't let him get away this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's difficult to capture only Welsh without the others noticing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,since Joris is keeping watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunning cheater, it's all his fault. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For Mother and Bonta, they must disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.30,0:19:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Little brat, you're trying to use power you can't control. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.57,0:19:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice, I know it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stubborn kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Shedar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, I've seen you somewhere before. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth are you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, show me your true form!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Azalar's child... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even uglier than your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dardondakal, do you still intend to keep playing dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Khan...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't we supposed to set off at dawn, little friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Joris-sensei, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.51,0:22:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Welsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.91,0:22:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me be alone for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.85,0:22:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I sleep for another hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Bechamel. You've rested enough. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll reach the Temple of Baccara soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,, I doubt Baccara will give us a warm welcome, \Nbut pack your luggage and let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.57,0:23:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it going to be, Dardondakal?
